# HANDOFF — Fix Login Page Redirect Loop

> Zero-context handoff for the next AI session.
> Generated: 2026-07-26 · Session length: ~18 substantive exchanges

---

## 1. Task

Fix the login page redirect loop in the Next.js dashboard app. Users with expired tokens get caught in an infinite redirect between `/login` and `/dashboard`, never landing on the login form.

---

## 2. Completed

| Item | Status | Detail |
|------|--------|--------|
| Root cause identified `[V]` | ✅ | `AuthGuard.tsx:42` — `useEffect` dependency on `user` triggers re-render loop |
| Token expiry check added `[V]` | ✅ | `src/utils/token.ts:15` — `isTokenExpired()` decodes JWT `exp` claim |
| Redirect logic refactored `[V]` | ✅ | `AuthGuard.tsx` split into `AuthGuard` (render) + `useAuthRedirect` (logic) |
| Unit tests `[V]` | ✅ | 7 new tests in `__tests__/auth-guard.test.tsx`, all pass |

