## 6. Pitfalls

| # | What happened | Why | Correct approach |
|---|---------------|-----|------------------|
| 1 | First fix tried `router.replace` directly in `useEffect` — caused double redirect | `useEffect` ran before `user` state settled | Redirect inside the `!user` early-return instead |
| 2 | `isTokenExpired()` initially used `Date.now()` — tests flaky | Non-deterministic timestamp | Accept `now` as optional parameter, inject in tests |

---

## 7. Decisions

| Decision | Why | Rejected alternatives |
|----------|-----|----------------------|
| **Split `AuthGuard` into two hooks** | Separate render guard from redirect logic — easier to test in isolation | Single hook with flags: test matrix exploded |
| **Check `exp` on client, not server** | Avoid waterfall — server-side check would add 200ms per page load | SSR middleware: too slow for this use case |

